		{
			dependencies: ["18561A07B84D2E7E"]
			description: [
				"他只是个倒霉的商人，错的时间出现在了错误的地方。或许有点无赖，假装失明……但他不值得死。"
				""
				"问题是，他自那时起就被困在这里，受困于那份不公。但我认为我知道他真正需要什么：一个&a名字&r。没有名字，他就卡在两个世界之间，永远不属于任何一方。如果你能弄到&b命名牌&r并&6给他一个&r，或许就能解决问题。新名字，新生活，你懂吗？"
			]
			id: "05F023CB8156D1C9"
			rewards: [{
				exclude_from_claim_all: true
				id: "0E77ADE24EB13C80"
				table_id: 7493974820583889365L
				type: "choice"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "2E14B20A6ABB632C"
				item: "minecraft:name_tag"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -7.5d
			y: 29.3d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["76195CAF71CCF73B"]
			description: [
				"可能需要一点时间，但&6仔细观察这本书&r，翻译最终会浮现在你眼前。你能行的。"
				""
				"请尽量确保你&d不被打断&r，否则将需要重新开始。"
			]
			id: "18561A07B84D2E7E"
			progression_mode: "linear"
			require_sequential_tasks: true
			rewards: [
				{
					auto: "enabled"
					id: "0213CF284C24B4BE"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "unknown"
							generation: 3
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"It was a cold and wicked winter when the stranger arrived. He was blind, dressed in tattered monk robes, and was peddling wares from all corners of the land. Buying and selling was his trade, and he never stayed in one place for very long.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"No one knew why he wandered, or where he'd come from. Most didn't ask, but those that did were met with a smile and a shrug.\\n\\nWhat was oddest about him, though, was that it seemed, for all intents and purposes, as if he had preternatural sight. \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"He walked without a cane, and easily appraised items he was presented. The children would often try to test him by holding up fingers or objects, but he guessed unerringly, every time. So perhaps it was inevitable that mistrust would one day get the better of him.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"The night that he arrived in the village, there was a cruel blizzard. It tore through, freezing livestock and anyone unfortunate enough to venture out. By morning, the bodies were stiff as ice. But not the stranger.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"He was not only alright, but he was smiling. Perhaps that's why they killed him. The people hounded him down and slipped a noose around his neck.\\n\\nWith his last breath, he tried to choke out a plea, but to no avail.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"His body was left hanging from the old oak for the rest of the winter, but it never seemed to freeze.\\n\\nIn the end, no one remembered what he was called. And now, his name is lost forever, even to himself.\"}"
							]
							resolved: 1b
							title: "无名上吊者"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					advancement: "dying_light:nameless_hanged/nameless_story"
					criterion: ""
					id: "2581F83E09B5B153"
					type: "advancement"
				}
			]
			tasks: [{
				icon: "minecraft:writable_book"
