					item: {
						Count: 1
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "unknown"
							display: {
								Name: "{\"font\":\"runelic:runelic\",\"text\":\"Herobrine\"}"
							}
							generation: 3
							pages: [
								"{\"font\":\"runelic:runelic\",\"text\":\"Legends say that Herobrine was once a man named Steve, but this is not quite so.\\n\\nThe being you call Herobrine is not of this realm at all, but instead hails from a distant plane, cold and lifeless, and always dark. A plane of dust and nothingness.\"}"
								"{\"font\":\"runelic:runelic\",\"text\":\"He is not a true creature, but one of diaphanous thought. No brain, no heart, no soul. A hollow, pale existence.\\n\\nHe was drawn to this realm by the sunshine, leaking in through a crack in reality. He passed through, and was enraptured.\"}"
								"{\"font\":\"runelic:runelic\",\"text\":\"There he met a human - perhaps one named Steve - and became obsessed with his vigor.\\n\\nHerobrine tried to mimic his appearance, but it brought him no revelations. Still, he lingered, copying Steve's actions like an echo.\"}"
								"{\"font\":\"runelic:runelic\",\"text\":\"He wishes to be alive the way we are. To feel the heat of blood pulsing through your veins; to enjoy the taste of fresh, wholesome food; to succumb to the gentleness of an embrace.\"}"
								"{\"font\":\"runelic:runelic\",\"text\":\"The stark oblivion of his home is so far removed from our vibrant lush world, that he simply cannot comprehend our experience. He fundamentally lacks the tools we use to interpret our lives.\"}"
								"{\"font\":\"runelic:runelic\",\"text\":\"He tries to get a semblance of life by possessing villagers, creatures, even monsters. In those bodies, he can pretend he feels the brilliant sunshine or the comforting rain.\\n\\nBut he cannot understand.\"}"
								"{\"font\":\"runelic:runelic\",\"text\":\"He cannot truly feel, and his inability drives him mad. The lack of soulfulness permeates him in every cell of his borrowed body. What he desires the most, he can never have.\\n\\nSo he haunts this world, appearing in the form of a man in blue.\"}"
							]
							title: "Herobrine"
						}
					}
					type: "questsadditions:use"
					value: 1L
				}
			]
			title: "准备好你的学习用品"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 26.299999999999997d
		}
		{
			can_repeat: true
			dependencies: ["2B3FA4EB128B72F2"]
			description: [
				"拍下并制作一张&b&eHerobrine&r的照片。你可以通过他&a发光的白眼睛&r来辨认他。这将捕捉到他的部分精髓，可以放入&bPoppet&r中，用于即将到来的仪式。"
				""
				"有个被称为&eLimbo Guardian&r的存在，他承载着这个领域中每个被困灵魂的传说。你、我，以及所有生活在这里的奇异生物。你无法直接看到他们或与他们交谈，但他们就在那里。"
				""
				"你可以&a举行仪式与&r此生物沟通。这样，它们应该&a会给你完成这些任务所需的信息&r。"
				""
				"&d如果你弄丢了&bPoppet&r，这个任务可以重复完成&r。"
